# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte, and frozen since its recorder went with the C# core host on 2026-11-07 - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command framelog
usage 1   framelog add <space> <addr> [<width>]
usage 2                                 register a per-frame value sample (width 1/2/4 bytes, default 1)
usage 3   framelog list                 list active frame logs with their IDs
usage 4   framelog show <id> [<count>]  show a frame log's recorded (frame, value) samples (default 20)
usage 5   framelog clear <id>           clear a frame log's stored samples (doesn't remove it)
usage 6   framelog remove <id>          remove a frame log entirely

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ framelog list
out 65
Error: No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
end

